   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Falgan",
   "npc": "257663",
   "questID": 94438,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I'm... back? And saved by a $c no less? I see you carry a Symbol of Life. I've not seen one of those since... well, since before the war when Lordaeron was a very different place. I can only assume you are here to help. Billmuth and I were sent here to scout out the scarlet activity here, and we found out that they are planning some kind of attack.\r\n\r\nIf you would be willing to help more, there may yet be more that you can do to help the Forsaken.",
   "time": 1791345166,
   "title": "A Lesson in Divinity",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "94440-accept": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Falgan",
   "npc": "257663",
   "questID": 94440,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "These Scarlet Crusaders often carry satchels with their deployment orders. We know an attack is coming, but if we can recover their orders, we can warn the rest of the Deathguard and prepare an ambush. \r\n\r\nYou are clearly an impressive $c. Kill these scarlet animals and retrieve a copy of their orders and bring them back to Deathguard Billmuth. He'll take it from there.",
   "time": 1791345166,
   "title": "A Lesson in Divinity",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "94440-progress": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
